{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_0_how_javascript_runs_reading_the_spec_toprimitive", "label": "ToPrimitive", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-0-how-javascript-runs/reading-the-spec.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hint string tries toString then valueOf. Hint number or default tries valueOf then toString. + uses default; templates use string; arithmetic uses number."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_0_how_javascript_runs_reading_the_spec_date_default_hint", "label": "Date overrides default ToPrimitive hint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-0-how-javascript-runs/reading-the-spec.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Date makes hint default behave as string, so date + '' is a date string while date * 1 is a timestamp."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_0_how_javascript_runs_reading_the_spec_default_sort_strings", "label": "Default Array.sort string compare", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-0-how-javascript-runs/reading-the-spec.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "[10, 9, 1].sort() is [1, 10, 9] because SortCompare stringifies. Specified, not a quirk."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_0_how_javascript_runs_reading_the_spec_living_standard", "label": "ECMA-262 living standard", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-0-how-javascript-runs/reading-the-spec.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read tc39.es/ecma262, not a numbered edition PDF. Host APIs are in WHA